WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.534 line:0%
And finally, New Rule.

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:03.302 line:0%
Democrats must learn how
to support

00:00:03.402 --> 00:00:05.872 line:0%
