of their coalition:

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:07.140 line:0%
other Democrats.

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:09.509 line:0%
(AUDIENCE CHEERS)

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.547 line:0%
I know everyone is excited
about Conor Lamb

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:16.282 line:0%
winning in Pennsylvania
this week

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:19.385 line:0%
but watching his TV ad
is why I worry...

00:00:19.752 --> 00:00:21.287 line:0%
about how this party fights.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:24.023
LAMB:<i> My opponent wants you
 to believe the biggest issue</i>

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:25.925
<i> in this campaign
 is Nancy Pelosi.</i>

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:27.427 line:0%
It's all a big lie.

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:30.095
<i> I've already said
 on the front page
 of the newspaper</i>

00:00:30.195 --> 00:00:31.831
<i> that I don't support
 Nancy Pelosi.</i>

00:00:32.698 --> 00:00:36.535
Okay, so this was
a special election
to replace a Republican

00:00:36.869 --> 00:00:38.905
who was staunchly pro-life
but got caught

00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:41.640
pressuring his mistress
to have an abortion...

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.076
and the Democrats let it
become a referendum

00:00:44.176 --> 00:00:45.611
on Nancy Pelosi?

00:00:46.078 --> 00:00:47.146
How about this for an ad?

00:00:47.246 --> 00:00:48.747
"Democrats support abortion.

00:00:48.847 --> 00:00:51.618
So do Republicans when they
need one for their girlfriend."

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.487
(APPLAUSE)

00:01:00.926 --> 00:01:04.797
Nancy Pelosi... was never
a scary radical,

00:01:05.264 --> 00:01:07.700
and Democrats, long ago,
made a horrible mistake

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.837
in deciding that,
when the Republicans
called her that,

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:13.439
they would just duck
their heads and go along.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.108
-(SPARSE APPLAUSE)
-What Nancy Pelosi did...

00:01:16.208 --> 00:01:18.945
was pass the stimulus
that averted a depression,

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:22.582
passed the very best version
of a healthcare bill
this country's ever had,

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:25.184
pass Wall Street reform
after the Great Recession,

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:27.753
and the bill that saved
the auto industry,

00:01:27.853 --> 00:01:29.288
passed the Fair Pay Act...

00:01:29.388 --> 00:01:32.926
These are things to brag about,
not distance yourself from.

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:34.894
(AUDIENCE CHEERS)

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:42.434
Learn the lesson
that's staring you in the face

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:44.803
every day in the person
of Donald Trump.

00:01:44.903 --> 00:01:47.307
Voters don't care
about how smart you are,

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:49.175
just don't be a pussy.

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:51.311
(SPARSE APPLAUSE)

00:01:51.578 --> 00:01:54.380
Hilary Clinton got 26 percent
of the vote

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:55.647
in West Virginia.

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:57.283
Trump did better
with Hispanics

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:59.652
after calling them
rapists and killers.

00:02:00.452 --> 00:02:03.055
Trump once said,
to a crowd in Iowa...

00:02:03.455 --> 00:02:06.059
How stupid are the people
of Iowa?

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:07.861
(SPARSE LAUGHTER)

00:02:10.329 --> 00:02:12.232
...and then won Iowa
in a landslide...

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:13.199
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:14.566
...as the people cried,

00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:16.235
"It's about time
somebody levelled with us

00:02:16.335 --> 00:02:17.570
about how stupid we are!"

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.671
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:02:21.206 --> 00:02:24.009
Their attitude is
"Insult me, lie to me,

00:02:24.109 --> 00:02:25.478
just lead me."

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:29.315
Hilary had the right plan
for Coal Country:

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:30.749
get them off coal.

00:02:31.517 --> 00:02:33.686 line:0%
Now, we've got to move
away from coal,

00:02:33.919 --> 00:02:36.255 line:0%
and all the other
fossil fuels,

00:02:36.355 --> 00:02:38.458 line:0%
but I don't want to move
away from the people

00:02:38.558 --> 00:02:39.859 line:0%
who did the best they could

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:42.861 line:0%
to produce the energy
that we relied on.

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:45.665
Yeah. Everything
about that answer was right.

00:02:46.098 --> 00:02:48.267
But she did what Democrats
always do.

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:50.570
The second there was
the slightest backlash,

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:51.905
