00:02:52.171 --> 00:02:54.374
It was a mis-statement,

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:56.141
because what I was saying is
that--

00:02:56.241 --> 00:02:57.042
(RECORD SCRATCH)

00:02:57.142 --> 00:02:59.945
Stop. Stop! You already lost.

00:03:00.045 --> 00:03:02.682
It wasn't a mis-statement,
it was the truth.

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:03.983
(APPLAUSE)

00:03:05.384 --> 00:03:06.252
(LAUGHS)

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:11.023
